{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411230","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411230","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1441123001:1":{"text":"たまには地上に出て、新鮮な空気を吸うのも悪くないだろ。","source_cn":"偶尔到地面上散散步，透透气，真不错嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B639BA06E74DB04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441123002:0":{"text":"あれは……","source_cn":"这是……<key:dialog141>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90DC6F3E16F32C6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441123003:1":{"text":"あれは海だ、あれは砂浜、そして波だ。","source_cn":"这是大海，这是沙滩，这是海浪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2587D24B41AEB499","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1441123004:1":{"text":"これはターキー、そっちはヒツジ、あれは鳥だ！","source_cn":"这是火鸡，这是绵羊，这是飞鸟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC480C5B23C4E98C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1441123005:1":{"text":"聞きたいことが山ほどあるって顔だな？まあ、焦らずゆっくり勉強すればいい。","source_cn":"是不是还有很多问题想问？不着急，慢慢学。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC7F65C4648E855","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1441123006:1":{"text":"オルディン村だけじゃない、地上にはもっともっと広い世界が広がってるんだ。","source_cn":"这还只是深岩村这一小片地方，外面的世界大得很呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6812A7CCD5CA49D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1441123006":{"text":"オルディン村だけじゃない、地上にはもっともっと広い世界が広がってるんだ。","source_cn":"这还只是深岩村这一小片地方，外面的世界大得很呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6812A7CCD5CA49D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1441123007:1":{"text":"想像していたのとは、まったく違う……だが、それでいい。","source_cn":"是和想象中完全不同的世界……但这样就很好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC114AA602BBDCE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1441123008:1":{"text":"種族や環境は違えど、同じく生命の活気に溢れている。","source_cn":"族群不同，环境不同，但却同样充满生机。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EA69DBDD10E93CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1441123009:1":{"text":"地上の規則は、やはりサロクディアとは違うのか？","source_cn":"外面的世界运行规则和萨洛克兰不同吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6868355C83858F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1441123009":{"text":"地上の規則は、やはりサロクディアとは違うのか？","source_cn":"外面的世界运行规则和萨洛克兰不同吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6868355C83858F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1441123010:1":{"text":"そういや、フェリルが初めて地上に来た時も、質問ばかりだったな。","source_cn":"说起来，当初斐利尔来到地面上，也是这样问东问西呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x499630B2FE976E6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1441123011:1":{"text":"フェリルは植物が好きで、先祖の手記に書かれていた美しい景色に興味津々だった。","source_cn":"斐利尔一直喜欢植物，好奇祖先手稿中的美丽景象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E0030FA7F36FAE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1441123012:1":{"text":"きっと、この世界を好きになっていただろうな。","source_cn":"他一定很喜欢这样的世界吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0293F122D6B41D8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1441123013:1":{"text":"今後は、地上で暮らしたいと思うエクシルも現れるに違いない。","source_cn":"我相信，一定会有艾塞勒，愿意生活在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3E0BEEB569456AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"まったく違うな。","source_cn":"完全不同","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x10889A1CADFC9E1D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"まったく違うな。","female":"ま